<title>USA: Wellpoint to offer 13 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Wellpoint to offer 13 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>WellPoint Health Networks Inc said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of 13 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>All the shares will be offered by the California HealthCare Foundation, the company's main shareholder. WellPoint said it will not receive any proceeds from the offering.</p>
</text>
